  "notes": "{降格|こうかく} is a compound: {降|こう} (descend) + {格|かく} (rank).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {降格|こうかく}する (to be demoted)\n- {降格|こうかく}させる (to demote someone)\n- {降格|こうかく}{人事|じんじ} (personnel changes involving demotion)\n- {降格|こうかく}{処分|しょぶん} (demotion as disciplinary action)\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {昇格|しょうかく} (promotion in rank - opposite)\n- {昇進|しょうしん} (promotion)\n\nRELATED VOCABULARY:\n- {左遷|させん} (transfer to a less desirable position)\n- {解雇|かいこ} (dismissal)\n- {減給|げんきゅう} (salary reduction)",
